{"title": "Daylight: Sphere", "pageid": 2688, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Daylight:_Sphere", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Daylight.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Daylight.webp/300px-Daylight.webp, /w/images/5/52/Daylight.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Daylight.webp/300px-Daylight.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Daylight.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Daylight: Sphere</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 evocation spell</a>. This spell is a variant of the spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/25px-Daylight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/38px-Daylight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/50px-Daylight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/25px-Daylight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\">Daylight</a> This variant allows spellcasters to dispel darkness by summoning a sphere of light.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon a sphere of sunlight that dispels all darkness around it. The sphere cannot be moved.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 15 m (50 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 15 m (50 ft) Radius</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creates Area: Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Creates Area: Daylight</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Daylight</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Daylight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Daylight\"> Area: Daylight </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(area)\" title=\"Daylight (area)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Daylight_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(area)\" title=\"Daylight (area)\">Daylight</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 15 m (50 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 15 m (50 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>A sphere of powerful light, bright as the sun.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Daylight\"> Condition: Daylight </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(Condition)\" title=\"Daylight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(Condition)\" title=\"Daylight (Condition)\">Daylight</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Shining with the light of the sun. Dispels <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">Darkness</a> within a radius of 15 m (50 ft).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Enchant_Item\" title=\"Daylight: Enchant Item\">Enchant Item</a> version of this spell requires the target creature have a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapon</a> in their main hand.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> </span>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/40px-Daylight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/60px-Daylight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/80px-Daylight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/40px-Daylight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\">Daylight</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Darkness clouds within range are only dispelled when this sphere is initially summoned.</li>\n<li>Daylight does not cause <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Bloom\" title=\"Sussur Bloom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Bloom\" title=\"Sussur Bloom\">Sussur Blooms</a> to wither while in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although exposing <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">Duergar</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> and other NPCs to light within radius from spell does trigger <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunlight_Sensitivity\" title=\"Sunlight Sensitivity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp/20px-Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp/30px-Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp/40px-Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sunlight Sensitivity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp/20px-Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sunlight_Sensitivity\" title=\"Sunlight Sensitivity\">Sunlight Sensitivity</a>, it will not show any status effect for the player to see (e.g., as a passive or condition on their character sheets, if examined), yet one can check the combat logs to see the effects of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> being applied.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Unused Images</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Daylight_Sphere.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Tooltip Image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Daylight_Sphere.webp/180px-Daylight_Sphere.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Daylight_Sphere.webp/270px-Daylight_Sphere.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Daylight_Sphere.webp/360px-Daylight_Sphere.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tooltip Image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Daylight_Sphere.webp/180px-Daylight_Sphere.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Daylight_Sphere.webp\" clas